# Cooling Spire (CIPlay cooling_spire): the yard at 3 m round 0 0; Hedda's camp, her welcome, her chest, the second
# landing and its rats, its locker, the roof and its bear, the roof chest, the lookout, what Hedda saw; the treasure.
island Cooling Spire
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Cold Spire
zone hedda_camp
expect step 1
read Hedda's welcome
expect step 2
open Hedda's chest
wait 3
expect step 3
zone landing_2
expect step 4
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
expect step 5
open Second landing
wait 3
zone spire_top
expect step 7
kill Polar bear
expect animals Polar bear 0
expect step 8
open Spire top
wait 3
expect step 9
read Pumpmen's log
use sunmirror2
expect step 10
zone coolridge
use sunmirror1
expect step 11
read Water plane log
expect step 12
open Sun-locked chest
wait 3
expect step 13
zone court_view
expect step 14
read What Hedda saw
dig
expect done
